      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the framed photo presentation",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the group holding the framed photo of the trans woman, as the meme's overall intent and the juxtaposition of images imply a direct address to the viewer regarding transphobia. The framing of the photo and the text 'no to transphobes' suggest the user is being invited to take a stance against transphobia, with the visual of the framed person serving as the focal point of this projection.",
